  "core_findings": [
    "Embedding scores span 0.5084–0.5137 across four categories, close to the 0.5 zero-cosine reference; they establish neither collapse nor recommendation quality.",
    "All four candidate audits failed because sklearn was unavailable, and no usable replay batches supported sampler checks or training margins. Recommendation behavior and training health therefore remain unassessed."
