  "key_implications": [
    "The available embedding measurements do not establish convergence or temporal generalization.",
    "Candidate-audit paired-user denominators, costs, partial completion, serving-parity evidence, bootstrap intervals and draw variability were not reported.",
    "No retrospective retrieval comparison or host-validation gain is established."
  ],
